                "text": "Today, I joined my colleague and friend, @RepMGriffith for a tour of Lee County Community Hospital alongside Ballad Health leadership and local staff. As the newly appointed Chair and Vice Chair of the House Energy and Commerce Health Subcommittee, Chairman Griffith and I are committed to advocating for strong, sustainable healthcare access in our nation\u2019s rural communities.\n\nWe\u2019re listening, and we\u2019ll continue working to ensure that Washington understands the healthcare needs of rural America.",
