                "text": "Big news: @HHSGov @SecKennedy & @CMSGov Admin. @DrOzCMS just opened applications for the $50B Rural Health Transformation Fund that was created by President Trump's Working Families Tax Cuts. This is the largest rural health investment in our nation\u2019s history, will create more access & keep services close to home.",
