                "text": "Applauding @POTUS, @SecKennedy, and @DrMakaryFDA for today\u2019s action removing outdated warnings on hormone therapy. As a pharmacist, I know this is a big win for women\u2019s health. We must also protect access to compounded bioidentical hormone therapy for patients who need individualized care. \u00a0#WomensHealth",
