                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The chemical abortion drug Mifepristone is being shipped like an Amazon package with ZERO in-person medical oversight.\n\nThat's why Congressman Chris Smith and I have sent a letter with 175 of our Republican colleagues asking Secretary Kennedy and FDA Commissioner Makary to, at a minimum, reinstate the in-person dispensing requirement for Mifepristone. Additionally, we asked them to expedite the promised review by the FDA into the dangers of abortion drugs.\n\nhttps://t.co/Tnqy3L34jw",
